Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||11-20-2001||07:11 PM||||I got an email today from a trance DJ who wants to talk to me about a web site.. the DJ goes by DJ Dragn'fly, and the main theme on the site is.. a dragonfly. anyway, the potential client wants a website that's dark, and "biomechanical" (think Borg from star trek, Aliens, HR Giger, etc)<P>Here's what I've come up with as a start, this is a mockup. Later I might add some mechanical parts inside the dragonfly, to make it look somewhat cyborg-ish.. I have a few more ideas for the site menu...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/transfer/dragnfly2.jpg"> <P>Comments? Suggestions? <P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
