Z||000009||DaRkLoRD||11-21-2001||12:08 AM||||Thanks for all the replies everyone!<P>I'm afraid I don't do much more than basic html coding, (thank you Dreamweaver!!) I'm just a designer.. (be it a website or a car modification..) My company does do some programming, I just don't do it myself.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>we do flash, CSS, javascript, etc.<P>I do the design, and as much of the work as I can.. but I do have a friend that does my flash, javascript and CSS work for me. so for me, it's creativity and several years of Photoshop experience.. no coding skill required. (basically I'm a lousy programmer.. LOL)<P>Joe: email me, I'd be happy to discuss your project with you!<P>p.s. yeah, it would make a decent cd cover.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (business card too maybe)<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
