Z||000011||DaRkLoRD||11-21-2001||10:19 AM||||it's a watermark.... there is no contract yet, I'm certainly not going to give them something that can be used without paying for it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I've had concept art stolen from me before, and used for a website with the person not paying for it. so since then, all concept art I do has "digital fusion" across it... figured it looked more professional than "sample" or something... it will not be present on the final image.<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
Z||000012||artherd||11-22-2001||04:41 AM||||Looks great!  Very 'Fight club' in a good way.<P>The design works well, what would be really cool is to integrate the 'Dragn' fly' text into the acutal veineation of the dragon fly there.  I'd do it in 3D, but you could probally get away with a little morphing and careful pencil work...<P>(PS: assume the text is a watermark, if not, loose it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I dig the design, keep up the edgy theme, it works.<P>Best!<BR>Ben<BR><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
